  "goodToKnow": "Chronologisch means chronological: in chronologischer Reihenfolge, chronologisch sortiert. Today's German Lebenslauf is usually umgekehrt chronologisch (reverse chronological), with the most recent job first. Die Chronologie is chronology, and die Chronik is a chronicle. Don't mix it up with chronisch (chronic), as in eine chronische Krankheit. From Greek chronos (time)."
